{
  "id": "waveshare-s3-eth",
  "name": "Waveshare ESP32-S3-ETH / ESP32-S3-POE-ETH",
  "short": "ESP32-S3-ETH",
  "chip": "ESP32-S3",
  "notes": "ESP32-S3R8 (8 MB octal PSRAM) with 16 MB flash, W5500 SPI Ethernet (PoE with the optional PoE module), camera connector (OV2640/OV5640), microSD slot and RGB LED. Pico-style 2x20 header, drawn from the Ethernet-jack side with USB at the bottom; Waveshare's pinout picture shows the other side with USB at the top. VBUS is the 5 V rail and is live on PoE as well as USB; VSYS is the same rail after a diode. PresenceCam doesn't use the camera: leave the camera connector empty, because its pins are handed out to sensors. GPIO33-37 go to the octal PSRAM and can't be used. GPIO21 is the RGB LED. The ACT and LINK LEDs are driven by the W5500.",
